# text_field_selected.png: the text field once test/selected.txt has dragged the mouse across its first word.
# Rendered by the stock engine's flutter_tester with Impeller, given the
# same edits above the engine (test/text_field_test.dart); against
# fl-engine's frame given them as input events, both at DPR 3 with Roboto
# from the Flutter cache. Percent of pixels allowed to differ in any
# channel, and by more than 32.
#
# The differences are glyph edges, as text.tolerance's. Measured
# 2026-11-16, lavapipe: 0.231% differ, 0.009% by more than 32.
differ 0.4
differ_over_32 0.05
